    {
      "type": "ascii",
      "start": 2049,
      "end": 2406,
      "text": "The 'firing pod' described in Capabilites is used as follows; any weapons in either arm can either be fired as per the usual, or, in times of time constraint, they can all be fired with one roll of the dice, location is still rolled for each weapon, but there is only one roll to hit. \r\n\r\n\r\nSubmitted by: Albrect Jorgennson, Clan Ghost Bear Head Technician."
    },
